[root] Caravan anchor implementation (packet plan) (planning)
Execute the independent packets below. Keep SDK objects separate from Caravan game objects, use direct indexed queries rather than interval stepping, and dispatch packets only after their dependencies are reviewed. The cellular automata anchor proposal is the shared behavior target. Files: proposals/cellular-automata-anchor.md; proposals/semantic-contract.md; roadmap.md; spec/initial.md
