[journal-writer] Journal writer and entries (reviewing)
Files: crates/engine-journal/**; consume engine-sdk and caravan-domain APIs
Do: Implement immutable journal values and a journal-owned monotonic writer that can postdate entries before evaluation, preserve equal-time append order, and publish typed game entries without caller-owned timestamps. Use the SDK envelope types as the storage boundary; identify any constructor visibility gap for the later purity-hardening packet without expanding scope into game evaluation.
Accept: Writer tests cover advance_to, record, postdated visibility, backward rejection, empty journals, and exact target-time inclusion. No branch correction logic is owned here.
-> domain-model
-> sdk-envelopes
@artifact text/plain crates/engine-journal/src/lib.rs
