[branch-model] Counterfactual and corrected branches (reviewing)
Files: crates/engine-branches/**; consume engine-sdk and engine-journal APIs
Do: Implement immutable inclusive-prefix branch construction for counterfactual and corrected suffixes. Preserve parent journals, retain fork boundaries, and expose one branch value to the query layer. Keep branch construction value-producing and do not add merge or networking semantics.
Accept: Tests prove prefix agreement, suffix replacement, late-entry correction, parent/child isolation, and nested branch behavior without mutation. Document any SDK/journal interface gap for a later packet rather than editing unrelated crates.
-> journal-writer
-> sdk-envelopes
